2026-10-20T07:40:52.1137430Z 
2026-10-20T07:40:52.1137580Z To start php@8.4 now and restart at login:
2026-10-20T07:40:52.1137960Z   brew services start php@8.4
2026-10-20T07:40:52.1138480Z Or, if you don't want/need a background service you can just run:
